34,2,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads were closed eleven days, but the halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The outer wards lost their bus link; it is an hour's round trip now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The old outreach stops averaged forty visitors, more than the main building.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The vehicle line overran by a third, but the grant only covers twelve months.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have retired tradespeople, but no one on payroll is trained to supervise.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, that attendance figure is surprising. Did they really outperform the main branch?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, if the grant expires, who pays for the sessions after that?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Yes, the records show they were very popular. It seems we ignored that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,The flat operating budget carries them after the grant ends. That is a risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, if the halls worked, why did we stop supporting them?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I think we underestimated the community's resilience and local organization.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The bus loss makes a mobile service seem more urgent, but also harder.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"We need to look at the digital archive too, but the old one was half done.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The equipment allocation closed under budget, which is good, but the running costs are high.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,The tool certification lapsed when the technician retired. That is a gap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must ensure whatever we choose does not depend on fragile external links.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"A mobile branch could bridge the bus gap, but the running costs worry me.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,The language circles seem to have worked well when partners were involved.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The endowment covers capital, but not the ongoing session fees. That is the trap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,We need a plan for supervision if we bring in outside facilitators.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
